(xii)
"Provisional Designated Partner Identification Number" refers to the provisional identification number generated by the
electronic system setup by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs;
(xiii)
"Registrar" means a Registrar as defined under clause (s) of sub-section (1) of section 2 of the Act;
(xiv)
"Registrar's Front Office" means an office maintained by the Central Government or an agency authorised by it to
facilitate e-filing of documents into the electronic registry and their inspection and viewing;
